<section>
  <grid spacing="none">
    <grid-item colspan="19" padding="0">
      <ai-image prompt="Elevated documentary photograph of an unbranded tractor approaching a field headland where inputs, tools and a support trailer have been staged in an orderly sequence, short turning path and reduced waiting geometry clearly visible, neutral overcast daylight, realistic soil texture, machine-gray equipment with restrained signal-red route markers, no text, no logos, no identifiable people" image-style="technical-field-documentary" aspect-ratio="portrait" fill="true"></ai-image>
    </grid-item>
    <grid-item colspan="41" vertical-align="center">
      <p role="eyebrow">Illustrative case study · same 12 ha field</p>
      <h2>Remove waiting before adding power</h2>
      <p>Better headland routing and staged inputs raise assumed field efficiency from 0.70 to 0.82. Width, speed and the $54/hour cost remain unchanged.</p>
      <grid spacing="medium" vertical-sizing="hug">
        <grid-item colspan="30" cell-style="subtle">
          <labels><label variant="outline">Before</label></labels>
          <display size="md">0.70</display>
          <h4>Efficiency → capacity</h4>
          <p>0.70 ha/hour effective capacity</p>
          <hr color="neutral-border"></hr>
          <p><b>17.14 hours</b><br/>$77.14/ha<br/>$925.71 total</p>
        </grid-item>
        <grid-item colspan="30" cell-style="subtle">
          <labels><label variant="solid">After</label></labels>
          <display size="md">0.82</display>
          <h4>Efficiency → capacity</h4>
          <p>0.82 ha/hour effective capacity</p>
          <hr color="neutral-border"></hr>
          <p><b>14.63 hours</b><br/>$65.85/ha<br/>$790.24 total</p>
        </grid-item>
      </grid>
      <grid spacing="none" vertical-sizing="hug">
        <grid-item background-color="accent" padding="12pt 16pt">
          <h3>2.51 hours and $135.47 saved</h3>
          <p>14.6% less time and cost—without more width or power.</p>
        </grid-item>
      </grid>
    </grid-item>
  </grid>
</section>